- **Dart runner:**
  - It compiles all test namespaces through the cljd CLI, then writes up to min(8, cores) shards under `build/cljd-agg/`, balanced greedily by file size.
  - It runs `flutter test --concurrency N` on the shards, exits non-zero on failure, and always deletes the shards.

